14. Upon careful review of the available material, as there is no risk of interference with the ongoing investigation by the petitioner, this Court is inclined to grant anticipatory bail to the petitioner/A. 12 under the following ) conditions;
(i) In the event of his arrest, the petitioner / A. 12 shall be released on bail on executing a personal bond for a sum of Rs. 10,000/- (Rupees ten thousand only) each, with two sureties for the like sum each to the satisfaction of the arresting police officials,
(ii) The petitioner shall appear before the Station House Officer concerned, once in a week i.e., on every Sunday between 10.00 AM and 05.00 PM till filing of the charge sheet,

